  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Reckless Savage voice names three immortal moves created after reading Pursuing Freedom in The Legends of Ren Zu. The first is Thunder Rush Yellow Bird Transformation, using attitude Gu as the core. The voice asks whether one has envied birds and wanted to fly freely, then points to human limits since birth and to wingless birds that once flew and lost their wings. Triggering all three merges them into Incomplete Freedom Transformation.",
      "chapters": [
        1956
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "gu_attitude_gu",
        "move_incomplete_freedom_transformation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Incomplete Freedom Transformation is made up of internal breathing green fish transformation, devouring blue leopard transformation, and thunder rush yellow bird transformation.",
      "chapters": [
        2175
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combination-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A part of Incomplete Freedom Transformation is thunder rush yellow bird transformation. It is a fierce method that shoots yellow lightning, and its power is magnified several times in Zhan Bu Du’s hands when he opens his mouth and yellow lightning erupts from his roar.",
      "chapters": [
        2191
      ],
